data: {"id": "61c8acd8105f412c-thinking-parallel_evidence-591", "run_id": "61c8acd8105f412c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据采集结论\n\n#### 已采集事实\n1. **Pod 状态确认**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 处于 `Pending` 阶段，容器状态为 `ContainerCreating`，尚未进入 Running。\n2. **直接异常事件 (FailedCreatePodSandBox)**：\n   - `kubelet` 报错 `FailedCreatePodSandBox`，根本原因是 **NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' 在 namespace `aiops-case-05` 中不存在**。\n   - 使用的网络插件为 `multus-cni-network` (Multus CNI)。\n3. **Pod YAML 规格**：\n   - 容器 `app` 镜像为 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，未设置 `runtimeClassName`。\n   - Pod 被调度到 `no", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789059562947, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "61c8acd8105f412c-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "61c8acd8105f412c", "seq": 592, "ts_ms": 1789059572005, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 45.709, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/61c8acd8105f412c-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "892bcd7d3f6fd0b7f0b5cd46c67c5ac098e9df5256d971e222c6012df5149e8e", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "f4f7f2e051de673ac0ae359dae66883973d39de5095d1c25b44501009b45cb82"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

